    <briefdescription>
<para>A few GPU targets, such as DXIL and SPIR-V, have typed pointers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This pointer type abstraction is used for tracking the types of these pointers. It is not legal to use this type, or derived types containing this type, in LLVM IR. </para>
